WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.883 --> 00:00:10.193
Not every administrator can do everything. This video explains the three permission levels, and who to contact when you need something this portal doesn't do.

2
00:00:10.694 --> 00:00:22.894
The label beside each name shows their level. A primary administrator can do it all: invite teachers, resend and extend invitations, revoke invitations, and remove teachers.

3
00:00:23.396 --> 00:00:34.166
A secondary administrator can do the day to day work, like inviting teachers, resending, and extending invitations. They can't revoke a seat or remove a teacher.

4
00:00:34.667 --> 00:00:45.247
A read only administrator can look at everything, but can't change anything. It's a good fit for someone who just needs to see reports. Read Only is the label next to this account.

5
00:00:45.748 --> 00:00:57.518
If you press a button your level doesn't allow, you'll see a message that tells you why. You won't be sent to the sign in page. Here, this read only administrator tries to invite a teacher.

6
00:00:58.021 --> 00:01:04.881
The message says the administrator role is read only. Nothing was sent, and the page stays right where it was.

7
00:01:05.382 --> 00:01:21.982
Back on the Organization page, the list of co-administrators shows who else has access. Administrators are set up by Fixer Nation or by your district, not from this page. If you need to add someone, change a level, or remove someone, email us.

8
00:01:22.484 --> 00:01:39.934
The same goes for adding seats, renewing your license, changing your school name, or anything about billing. Email support at Fixer Nation Education dot com, and tell us your school's domain so we can find your account quickly. We usually reply within one business day.
